    {
      "value": "A thin crust flat on dead oak, pale lilac and waxy when damp, pinker and hard when dry.",
      "sources": [
        "fn",
        "wp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "value": "Its edges often lift and curl away from the wood, showing a dark underside.",
      "sources": [
        "fn",
        "wp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "value": "On dead oak branches, all year.",
      "sources": [
